  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDB LOC Building Capacity and Resilience in the Health Sector to Respond to the Coronavirus-2019 Project - Saint Lucia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall impact of this project is enhanced health system resilience to respond to health security threats while continuing to provide quality essential health services. There are two specific  outcomes  under  the  Project:  (a) enhanced  capacity to  break  the  chain  of  transmission  of COVID-19  and  other  health  security threats;  and  (b)  improved  service  delivery  capacity for  COVID-19 affected persons and others.</narrative>
  </description>
